I was playing a series of games on NAO a few months ago, with the aim of
improving on my previous best ascension streak. I ended up with a
remarkable streak of 10 ascensions, and so here I am (after some delay
until I got around to composing my notes and gathering the relevant
URLs) posting about it.

Brief Nethack bio: I started playing back at school in 1995, without
ever getting far. I played intermittently for years, without much
success; I think the furthest I got was the Valley, maybe in 2002 or so.
After not playing for some years, I started again, on NAO, in 2007,
where I ascended for the first time.

My previous best streak was 3 games, and so my aim in this set of games
was to improve to 4 or 5, playing all different roles (which is why I
played the easier roles in games 3-5). Around 5 games in to the streak, I
started writing down descriptions of the games, and later I went back
and filled in descriptions of the earlier ones.

